0: DECL INT, α
1: STEP
2: DECL INT, β
3: STEP
4: DECL INT, γ
5: STEP
6: PUSH 2
7: STORE α
8: STEP
9: PUSH 4
10: STORE β
11: STEP
12: PUSH 6
13: STORE γ
14: STEP
15: VERI 0, '∀ x ∈ [α, β, γ] . &x > 0'
16: VERI 1, '∃ μ ∈ [0...2] . (&μ = 1) && (γ = 6)'
17: VERI 2, '∀ i in [0...2] . (&i = 0) => (α = 2)'